--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7ed8d592803d6492b8f1f0ac1555a1ea, type: 3}
  m_Name: Storage
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: InsightsSamples.Common::InsightsSamples.Common.SampleInfo
  id: 11-storage
  number: 11
  title: Storage
  series: Context & identity
  icon: hard-drive
  scenario: Resume a long equipment course
  realWorld: "Forklift technicians work through a three-chapter maintenance course over several days, often on different headsets. The course remembers where each learner stopped, and keeps a history of completed chapters for audits."
  teaches: StorageSetEntry, StorageGetEntry, StorageRemoveEntry
  sceneName: Storage
  appWidePrefab: {fileID: 0}
  whatThisShows: Save a learner's place in a long course with Insights storage, and
    resume it on any headset. KeepLatest replaces an entry; AppendHistory adds to
    it. User scope follows the learner; Device scope stays with this headset or browser,
    and is all an app has when its sign-in identifies nobody.
  tryThis:
  - 'Complete a chapter or two, wait until the save rows show a green dot (sent), then
    leave and come back: when signed in, the console resumes.'
  - Reset progress removes the saved place; the history stays.
  - 'Where the sign-in asks for no user, progress saves to this device instead: the
    console says which.'
  - Signed out, storage calls do nothing, and the Stream says so.
  watchFor:
  - 'Two StorageSetEntry rows per chapter: course_progress (KeepLatest) and attempt_history
    (AppendHistory).'
  - Reading and removing entries make no record, so they have no row.
  lessonScript: StorageSample.cs
  lessonScriptLine: 74
  dashboardNotes:
  - methodPrefix: Storage
    note: 'Storage: app data per learner or device, not an analytics record'
  expectedOnPass:
  - method: StorageSetEntry
    name: course_progress
    count: 3
    atLeast: 0
    status: 
  - method: StorageSetEntry
    name: attempt_history
    count: 3
    atLeast: 0
    status: 
  expectedOnFail:
  - method: StorageSetEntry
    name: course_progress
    count: 1
    atLeast: 0
    status: 
  - method: StorageSetEntry
    name: attempt_history
    count: 1
    atLeast: 0
    status: 
